            "book": "2CH",
            "chapter": 21,
            "verse": 10
          },
          "text": "So Edom has been in revolt from under the hand of Judah to this day. Then Libnah revolted at the same time from under his hand, because he had forsaken the LORD, the God of his fathers.",
